    "decisions":  [
                      "Use the original geometric p/point symbol and path-based lowercase pospoint wordmark. Logo variants share a 352 by 64 viewBox; use the pale-blue light variant on dark surfaces.",
                      "Use cobalt #2458ED for primary actions, ink #141B2D for text and the footer, chalk #F5F7FA for quiet surfaces, and mist #DCE6FF for restrained accents.",
                      "Preserve one centered content area at 90% of the viewport with a 1600px cap and aligned section edges.",
                      "Retain the original two-slide hero carousel and photo compositions through recolored hero1-pospoint.webp and hero2-pospoint.webp variants. Use cobalt/navy grading and ink overlays without green or lime tint. Preserve Georgian copy, catalog/company links, carousel controls, pause behavior, and reduced-motion support.",
                      "Keep the category carousel, eight featured products, interactive category product tabs, and compact company introduction. Use cobalt selected states and neutral-blue category surfaces.",
                      "Use Inter for Latin text and numerals with TWS Ajara TV Mt for Georgian; the custom logo is vector artwork and does not depend on a font.",
                      "Use restrained 8px control corners, 12px product/category cards, 16px larger surfaces, quiet borders, and generous spacing.",
                      "Keep generated pospoint-hero.webp and pospoint-retail.webp available as brand assets; the homepage retains its original carousel and photo compositions through recolored hero1-pospoint.webp and hero2-pospoint.webp variants.",
